      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOW IT'S DONE (4) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 17.13 beating Velvet Legend. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Hard to go past. ZINFANDEL PEARL (2) jumps from box 2 for the first time after scoring at this track (22.53) in a Grade 6. Form here excellent including two wins. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Likely to be in the finish. VICTA SPENCER (8) was an impressive winner last time in quickest of the meeting when scoring by 4.5 lengths (25.44) at this track. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. TERRIFIC LUCY (1) has strong credentials from this draw.",
